From 80111e70305f587016b9ea0b78560f596cc4e34f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sudharsan Eswaran <eswaran@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 22:36:21 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] certification topology sync fix with MTK device

 - Controller Auto-Configuration Response now reports Multi-AP Profile-2.
 - BSS Configuration Report is included in certification topology responses.
 - Neighbor bridge flag is changed to 0x01 only in certification mode.
 - Device Bridging Capability TLV is added only in certification mode.
 - MTK Ethernet MAC is retained in Non-1905 Neighbor TLV 0x06.
 - Unwanted vendor-specific topology TLVs are suppressed only in certification mode.
 - Normal field behavior remains unchanged when certification mode is disabled.

Signed-off-by: Sudharsan Eswaran <eswaran@qti.qualcomm.com>
---
 .../beerocks/slave/tasks/topology_task.cpp    | 116 +++++++++++++++---
 .../src/beerocks/slave/tasks/topology_task.h  |   6 +-
 .../bcl/source/beerocks_ucc_listener.cpp      |  13 +-
 controller/src/beerocks/master/controller.cpp |  13 +-
 4 files changed, 124 insertions(+), 24 deletions(-)

